First, I need to find the total number of students who like at least one of the foods. The problem says 40 like French fries and 30 like burgers. Then it also says 23 students like both. Since "both" is a separate category from just fries and just burgers, I should add all three groups together to get the total who like any food: 40 + 30 + 23 = 93 students.  
